===Etymology 1===
{{dercat|de|gem-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|tūbe}}, from {{inh|de|goh|tūba}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*dūbā}}. 

Compare {{cog|nds-de|Duuv}}, {{cog|nl|duif}}, {{cog|en|dove}}, {{cog|da|due}}, {{cog|sv|duva}}.

